    "expect": "base",
    "base_description": true
   },
   {
    "id": "C2",
    "text": "While the exception propagated through SSLTransport.__exit__() (or whenever the caller retained the exception object, or under non-refcounted GC such as PyPy), self.socket._io_refs remained 1.",
