    "testable": true,
    "expect": "differs"
   },
   {
    "id": "C5",
    "text": "Track the outermost constructed stream (raw, then buffer) and call resource.close() in except BaseException: before re-raising so SocketIO.close() decrements _io_refs cleanly via _decref_socketios().",
