    "source_quote": "Add regression tests verifying that failed `SSLTransport.makefile()` calls across unbuffered text mode, invalid `buffering` type, invalid `TextIOWrapper` arguments (`r`, `w`, `rw`), and `BufferedReader` initialization failures leave `sock._io_refs == 0` and immediately close the underlying socket FD (`sock.fileno() == -1`) on `SSLTransport.__exit__()`.",
